      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name}: Yes - I did. But it's probably good if it as close as possible to live by default.\n\nIn my opinion, SteamVR bindings are something for advanced users. Also after 5000 hours in VR, the UI of the bindings feels still complicated and unintuitive to me. There is no explanation - it's basically try and error and hoping the best. This should not be the first place a newbie has to go to adjust controllers.",
